                        "entry_id": "0320481c-f9d5-3107-b83f-8d7139c6cd9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A mess (disagreeable mixture or confusion of things; disorder)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "091f47b4-e930-303c-97e1-585b34294234",
                        "entry_id": "0320481c-f9d5-3107-b83f-8d7139c6cd9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A scramble, as when small objects are thrown down, to be taken by those who can seize them; a confused struggle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea027ce7-ed75-44fa-bc3f-2ea506c67322",
                                "sense_id": "091f47b4-e930-303c-97e1-585b34294234",
                                "text": "Authority melts from me: of late, when I cried 'Ho!' like boys unto a muss, kings would start forth, and cry 'Your will?' Have you no ears? I am Antony yet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d00225b-9c32-4e56-937e-46557080a251",
                                "sense_id": "091f47b4-e930-303c-97e1-585b34294234",
                                "text": "Gods so! a muss, a muss, a muss, a muss."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
